WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.479
Cinderella dropped the prince's hand.

2
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:12.753
She ran outside as the clock struck 12.

3
00:00:12.754 --> 00:00:16.843
"Wait!" the prince shouted. "Don't go!"

4
00:00:16.844 --> 00:00:19.614
Cinderella started down the steps.

5
00:00:19.615 --> 00:00:22.646
One of her glass shoes fell off.

6
00:00:22.647 --> 00:00:24.504
Cinderella looked back.

7
00:00:24.505 --> 00:00:29.626
But it was too late to get the shoe.

8
00:00:29.627 --> 00:00:35.628
Her golden coach was already a pumpkin.

9
00:00:35.629 --> 00:00:40.686
Her beautiful gown was an ugly old rag again.

10
00:00:40.687 --> 00:00:49.082
The prince ran down the steps.

11
00:00:49.083 --> 00:00:54.080
"Where is the princess?" he cried.

12
00:00:54.081 --> 00:00:57.362
He ran past Cinderella.

13
00:00:57.363 --> 00:00:59.700
Cinderella's heart sank.

14
00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:04.835
He didn't know that she was the princess!

15
00:01:04.836 --> 00:01:11.518
Slowly she began to walk home.

16
00:01:11.519 --> 00:01:16.321
The prince went back up the steps.

17
00:01:16.322 --> 00:01:19.679
Near the top step, something sparkled.

18
00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:23.245
"Hmm," the prince said.

19
00:01:23.246 --> 00:01:31.510
He picked it up. "What's this?"

20
00:01:31.511 --> 00:01:38.326
Cinderella got home.

21
00:01:38.327 --> 00:01:41.551
She was tired and cold.

22
00:01:41.552 --> 00:01:46.318
She added a log to the fire.

23
00:01:46.319 --> 00:01:52.536
Later the stepsisters came home.

24
00:01:52.537 --> 00:01:55.217
"How was the ball?" Cinderella asked.

25
00:01:55.218 --> 00:01:57.976
"Was the beautiful princess there again?"

26
00:01:57.977 --> 00:02:00.543
"Yes." Gert made a face.

27
00:02:00.544 --> 00:02:02.977
"She left at midnight.

28
00:02:02.978 --> 00:02:06.232
But the prince kept talking about her.

29
00:02:06.233 --> 00:02:11.370
He even found something of hers."

30
00:02:11.371 --> 00:02:15.160
Cinderella leaned forward. "What did he find?"

31
00:02:15.161 --> 00:02:21.111
"A glass shoe," Trudy said. "It's really pretty."

32
00:02:21.112 --> 00:02:24.165
"Cinderella!" Stepmother snapped.

33
00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:29.806
"Get our beds ready!"

